Third-party material
--------------------

Icons in app/src/main/res/raw/*.svg are path data from Google's Material Design
Icons (https://github.com/google/material-design-icons), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Spotify browsing and playback rely on the Spotty plugin for Lyrion Music
Server by Michael Herger (https://github.com/michaelherger/Spotty-Plugin),
which builds on librespot (https://github.com/librespot-org/librespot).
LegacyLyrion does not include any Spotty code; it talks to the plugin through
Lyrion's standard controller (Jive) menus. Spotty must be installed separately
on the Lyrion server, and is credited and licensed by its own authors.

YouTube Music browsing and playback rely on the YouTube Music for LMS plugin
by schmij97 (https://github.com/schmij97/lms-ytmusic), which uses yt-dlp
(https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp). LegacyLyrion does not include any of its
code; it talks to the plugin through the same Jive menus. The plugin must be
installed separately on the Lyrion server.

The approach for using HTC Sense's own theme and widgets (HtcDeviceDefault,
common_app_bkg, com.htc.widget.*) follows h33ted/htc-revive.

